WEBVTT

00:31.630 --> 00:35.180
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.200 --> 00:38.580
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.850 --> 00:44.820
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.980 --> 00:49.610
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.630 --> 00:53.140
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.160 --> 00:56.650
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.670 --> 01:00.180
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.200 --> 01:06.260
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.520 --> 01:23.800
Si Jin

01:23.820 --> 01:27.800
Episode 26

01:27.800 --> 01:29.940
(Earl Dongping's Mansion)

01:29.940 --> 01:31.300
Your Highness.

01:31.780 --> 01:33.220
Greetings, sir.

01:34.860 --> 01:37.180
Under your leadership, Capital Security has

01:37.180 --> 01:40.220
solved difficult cases and upheld justice.

01:40.340 --> 01:42.940
You're one of a kind,

01:42.980 --> 01:45.260
with unmatched talent.

01:46.140 --> 01:48.060
That's very nice of you to say.

01:48.420 --> 01:49.760
With all due respect,

01:49.780 --> 01:52.020
I can't let Si

01:52.340 --> 01:54.340
marry you.

01:58.260 --> 01:59.620
Sir,

02:00.340 --> 02:01.300
did I do

02:01.300 --> 02:02.500
anything wrong?

02:02.500 --> 02:04.140
Please enlighten me.

02:05.940 --> 02:07.460
Your Highness,

02:07.780 --> 02:09.740
you're a prince.

02:09.980 --> 02:12.040
Ever since you were born,

02:12.060 --> 02:13.540
you've been involved

02:13.540 --> 02:15.520
in power struggle.

02:15.540 --> 02:18.360
If Si married you,

02:18.380 --> 02:22.620
she'd never be safe.

02:27.420 --> 02:28.780
Sir,

02:29.420 --> 02:31.560
I promise to do my utmost

02:31.580 --> 02:33.420
to protect her

02:33.980 --> 02:36.900
and lead a peaceful life with her.

02:38.100 --> 02:39.780
I fear

02:40.740 --> 02:43.140
it'll turn out the opposite.

02:44.220 --> 02:46.860
You won't have a choice.

02:50.040 --> 02:53.200
(Haitang Chamber)

02:53.220 --> 02:55.940
(Qi)
Do you truly like Prince Yan?

03:03.980 --> 03:05.580
I admire him.

03:10.140 --> 03:12.160
I hate to upset you,

03:12.180 --> 03:14.080
but I've been in love, too.

03:14.100 --> 03:15.940
Here's my advice.

03:16.380 --> 03:17.800
As a prince

03:17.820 --> 03:19.380
of the imperial family,

03:19.580 --> 03:20.660
even if you two managed to

03:20.660 --> 03:21.720
hurdle the first barrier,

03:21.740 --> 03:23.520
and you were married into his mansion,

03:23.540 --> 03:25.440
no one could guarantee you'd live

03:25.460 --> 03:26.820
happily ever after.

03:27.300 --> 03:28.560
Don't worry about me.

03:28.580 --> 03:30.340
I'll take good care of myself.

03:32.800 --> 03:33.880
(Qi)

03:33.900 --> 03:35.260
Look at it.

03:50.100 --> 03:54.020
I'm simply curious.

03:55.260 --> 03:56.780
Why do you

03:56.780 --> 03:58.780
desire to be a heroine?

04:00.740 --> 04:02.420
I grew up in the army.

04:02.620 --> 04:04.340
I was surrounded by men.

04:05.220 --> 04:06.860
I heard all kinds of stories

04:06.860 --> 04:08.580
of heroes in my childhood.

04:08.780 --> 04:10.940
They made me wonder

04:11.220 --> 04:12.100
why the heroes

04:12.100 --> 04:13.420
in those stories

04:13.420 --> 04:15.060
were always men

04:15.340 --> 04:16.440
while women

04:16.460 --> 04:18.460
could only wait for their help.

04:18.700 --> 04:20.060
I found that unfair.

04:20.780 --> 04:22.320
Who says

04:22.340 --> 04:24.220
women can't be heroes?

04:24.660 --> 04:26.020
If men can be heroes,

04:27.020 --> 04:28.980
so can I, Lu Chuchu.

04:30.740 --> 04:32.700
I see.

04:36.000 --> 04:38.400
You're quite special.

04:38.420 --> 04:39.900
It seems

04:40.660 --> 04:41.640
that nothing can stop you

04:41.640 --> 04:43.260
from doing what you want.

04:43.540 --> 04:45.140
You only follow your heart.

04:50.180 --> 04:51.540
Jiang Zhan,

04:52.900 --> 04:54.500
thanks for your compliment.

05:09.860 --> 05:11.300
My sister is the same.

05:12.580 --> 05:14.940
Both of you have big hearts.

05:18.460 --> 05:19.600
It should be

05:19.620 --> 05:21.380
these people.

05:21.980 --> 05:23.300
The eclipse had been

05:23.300 --> 05:25.600
predicted and recorded.

05:25.620 --> 05:26.980
Read this.

05:28.540 --> 05:31.280
It says the next day,

05:31.300 --> 05:32.780
they overturned

05:32.780 --> 05:34.460
all the previous predictions.

05:36.580 --> 05:38.720
No wonder Supervisor Yang Nianzhi

05:38.740 --> 05:40.980
didn't receive any predictions
of the eclipse.

05:40.980 --> 05:43.640
Thankfully, we found
the Nightingale's secret letters.

05:43.660 --> 05:45.760
Otherwise, even if the eclipse were true,

05:45.780 --> 05:47.600
they'd be guilty of negligence at most.

05:47.620 --> 05:48.680
We can't wait.

05:48.700 --> 05:50.060
I'll put together the evidence

05:50.060 --> 05:51.180
and present it to His Majesty

05:51.180 --> 05:52.440
tomorrow morning.

05:52.460 --> 05:53.820
Appreciated.

05:55.960 --> 05:58.000
(5th-8th Year of Jingming)

05:58.880 --> 06:01.120
(Annals of Divination)

06:04.880 --> 06:06.440
(5th Year of Jingming)

06:06.440 --> 06:09.120
(2nd Year of Jingming, 4th Year of Jingming)

06:10.080 --> 06:12.300
(2nd Year of Jingming, 4th Year of Jingming)

06:15.800 --> 06:18.760
(Tiande Hall)

06:18.780 --> 06:20.120
Your Majesty,

06:20.140 --> 06:21.720
I'm also shocked

06:21.740 --> 06:24.100
by the number of those of Astronomy

06:24.100 --> 06:25.540
involved in this case.

06:25.560 --> 06:26.920
Head of Spring Office, Zhang Qi,

06:26.940 --> 06:28.160
Register Wei Yuan,

06:28.180 --> 06:30.100
and Observer Li Chujiang

06:30.460 --> 06:32.380
were all involved in the Hunt Case.

06:32.420 --> 06:33.960
To think the Nightingale

06:33.980 --> 06:36.800
has gone so deep in our state for so long.

06:36.820 --> 06:38.360
It's appalling!

06:38.380 --> 06:40.720
Astronomy failed in their duties.

06:40.740 --> 06:42.180
First, they made me send away my son

06:42.180 --> 06:44.640
based on their observation of the sky.

06:44.660 --> 06:47.600
Then they failed to predict the eclipse

06:47.620 --> 06:49.560
followed by an assassination.

06:49.580 --> 06:51.180
All of them are dismissed.

06:51.260 --> 06:54.120
Yang Nianzhi failed as the Supervisor.

06:54.140 --> 06:55.600
He'll lose two years' pay.

06:55.620 --> 06:57.460
With so many vacancies,

06:57.460 --> 06:58.900
I fear

06:59.060 --> 07:01.740
the wicked will rise to power.

07:08.220 --> 07:10.980
I'd like to recommend someone,

07:14.380 --> 07:16.820
Earl Dongping, Jiang Ancheng.

07:17.120 --> 07:21.560
(Capital Security Office)

07:21.580 --> 07:24.000
Are you making a kite?

07:24.020 --> 07:25.240
Yes.

07:25.260 --> 07:26.820
It's much easier to buy one.

07:26.820 --> 07:28.860
Handcraft is a lot of work.

07:29.340 --> 07:31.280
This one is different

07:31.300 --> 07:32.660
from those for sale.

07:32.700 --> 07:36.700
I'm making it for a...

07:37.660 --> 07:38.620
a girl

07:38.620 --> 07:39.980
in particular.

07:43.300 --> 07:44.640
Wait, what? For whom?

07:44.660 --> 07:45.760
A girl?

07:45.780 --> 07:46.880
Here's the thing.

07:46.900 --> 07:48.540
A few days ago,

07:48.580 --> 07:50.080
I mistook a girl for someone else,

07:50.100 --> 07:51.420
causing her some trouble.

07:51.420 --> 07:53.040
I'm making this kite

07:53.060 --> 07:54.080
for her

07:54.100 --> 07:55.460
as an apology.

07:56.340 --> 07:57.700
That's it?

07:58.660 --> 08:00.020
Yes.

08:04.180 --> 08:05.540
Good.

08:08.740 --> 08:10.100
Commandant Yu.

08:10.940 --> 08:12.420
What are you here for?

08:14.460 --> 08:16.180
Nothing serious.

08:18.540 --> 08:21.720
His Majesty means to
promote Earl Dongping, right?

08:21.740 --> 08:23.700
I think it's better to

08:23.700 --> 08:25.820
keep this news

08:25.940 --> 08:27.820
from his family.

08:34.260 --> 08:35.520
Do you mean

08:35.540 --> 08:37.540
to keep it from Miss Si?

08:37.660 --> 08:39.380
She might get worried.

08:40.460 --> 08:41.820
I see.

08:42.580 --> 08:44.200
Protect Earl Dongping

08:44.220 --> 08:45.980
from political struggle, huh?

08:46.420 --> 08:47.680
Rest assured.

08:47.700 --> 08:49.980
I won't tell anyone.

08:53.220 --> 08:54.620
Your Highness,

08:54.900 --> 08:56.560
Mr. Zhen had me

08:56.580 --> 08:59.020
bring you this kite.

08:59.620 --> 09:00.800
He said

09:00.820 --> 09:02.200
the bamboo flute on it

09:02.220 --> 09:04.660
would sound like this...

09:06.900 --> 09:07.940
in the wind.

09:07.940 --> 09:08.920
Ms. Hua.

09:08.940 --> 09:10.300
Yes.

09:10.420 --> 09:12.240
We'll fly it for you now.

09:12.260 --> 09:13.400
Hold on, Your Highness.

09:13.420 --> 09:14.780
Run!

09:15.270 --> 09:17.000
♪ From place to place ♪

09:17.000 --> 09:21.940
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

09:22.310 --> 09:24.640
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

09:24.660 --> 09:26.020
Your Highness,

09:26.060 --> 09:27.420
I know about

09:27.420 --> 09:29.100
a kite that sounds.

09:29.700 --> 09:31.380
Even if you can't see it,

09:31.620 --> 09:33.620
you'll know where the kite goes.

09:36.100 --> 09:37.580
A kite that sounds?

09:38.380 --> 09:40.620
Is there really such a thing?

09:40.900 --> 09:42.260
There is.

09:42.540 --> 09:44.240
When I come to the Palace next time,

09:44.260 --> 09:45.860
I'll bring it to you.

09:48.260 --> 09:49.300
Thank you, Mr. Zhen.

09:49.320 --> 09:53.400
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

09:53.640 --> 09:55.380
♪ Like shadows ♪

09:55.400 --> 10:00.100
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

10:00.100 --> 10:03.670
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

10:03.690 --> 10:07.920
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

10:07.940 --> 10:09.720
♪ Time glows ♪

10:09.720 --> 10:14.370
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

10:14.390 --> 10:18.090
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

10:18.110 --> 10:22.270
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

10:22.450 --> 10:24.210
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

10:24.210 --> 10:28.730
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

10:28.730 --> 10:32.370
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

10:32.390 --> 10:38.060
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

10:39.580 --> 10:41.680
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

10:41.680 --> 10:49.180
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪

10:56.140 --> 10:57.440
Has Fuqing gone to bed

10:57.460 --> 10:59.340
this early?

11:00.420 --> 11:01.780
Yes.

11:02.220 --> 11:03.660
She flew a kite in the morning.

11:03.660 --> 11:04.960
Maybe she was tired.

11:04.980 --> 11:05.900
She went to bed

11:05.900 --> 11:07.140
just after the Xu hour.

11:07.140 --> 11:08.620
(Ms. Hua, Empress Di)

11:08.620 --> 11:11.140
Why did she suddenly want to fly kites?

11:11.220 --> 11:13.400
She had never done that before.

11:13.420 --> 11:14.960
That kite seemed to be

11:14.980 --> 11:16.380
a gift from Mr. Zhen

11:16.380 --> 11:17.760
of Capital Security.

11:17.780 --> 11:19.460
Her Highness really liked it.

11:24.420 --> 11:26.080
Also,

11:26.100 --> 11:27.600
a bamboo flute

11:27.620 --> 11:28.540
was added to it

11:28.540 --> 11:29.960
that would sound in the wind.

11:29.980 --> 11:31.600
It was unique

11:31.620 --> 11:34.380
and different from those for sale.

11:34.620 --> 11:36.400
I think

11:36.420 --> 11:38.380
it was handmade by Mr. Zhen.

11:39.020 --> 11:40.500
Zhen Heng?

11:41.460 --> 11:43.120
His Majesty

11:43.140 --> 11:45.220
always speaks highly of him,

11:45.420 --> 11:48.200
saying he's erudite, upright,

11:48.220 --> 11:49.860
and devoted.

11:51.020 --> 11:53.580
How did he and Fuqing meet?

11:53.660 --> 11:55.900
A while ago,

11:55.940 --> 11:57.840
the two of them took shelter

11:57.860 --> 11:59.860
from the rain under the same eave.

12:00.060 --> 12:01.460
Really?

12:01.660 --> 12:03.820
What are the odds?

12:04.140 --> 12:05.860
I agree.

12:07.620 --> 12:08.980
Your Highness,

12:09.100 --> 12:10.880
it's said that His Majesty

12:10.900 --> 12:12.460
will hold a blossom-viewing banquet

12:12.460 --> 12:13.600
for Prince Shu

12:13.620 --> 12:14.920
and Prince Yan

12:14.940 --> 12:16.240
to select their wives.

12:16.260 --> 12:17.840
Actually,

12:17.860 --> 12:19.440
Princess Fuqing

12:19.460 --> 12:22.100
has reached the age of marriage as well.

12:27.620 --> 12:30.420
His Majesty has mentioned it a few times,

12:30.740 --> 12:32.700
but you know Fuqing's eyes.

12:33.940 --> 12:35.600
I wonder if her husband

12:35.620 --> 12:37.700
will treat her well.

12:39.260 --> 12:41.180
I hope

12:41.300 --> 12:43.580
she'll marry someone she loves

12:43.860 --> 12:46.220
who'll cherish her.

12:48.420 --> 12:50.380
Mr. Zhen seems to be

12:50.540 --> 12:52.100
a good choice.

13:03.860 --> 13:06.420
Greetings, Father.

13:08.300 --> 13:09.660
Jin,

13:09.740 --> 13:11.900
how are you settling into your mansion?

13:12.260 --> 13:14.500
Thanks for choosing the best for me, Father.

13:15.230 --> 13:16.400
Very well.

13:16.420 --> 13:19.200
Now, all you need is a wife.

13:19.220 --> 13:21.100
Ask Consort Xian to come over.

13:21.340 --> 13:23.680
Your mother can help you choose.

13:23.700 --> 13:24.780
You're old enough

13:24.780 --> 13:26.160
to get married.

13:26.180 --> 13:28.000
Does my marriage

13:28.020 --> 13:30.940
have to be decided by my mother?

13:31.300 --> 13:33.560
Those in the South can marry

13:33.580 --> 13:35.340
as long as they love each other.

13:37.340 --> 13:39.100
As Prince Yan,

13:39.980 --> 13:42.100
you have to abide by the rules.

13:43.020 --> 13:45.220
Things here are different from the South.

13:46.780 --> 13:48.140
Or are you

13:48.580 --> 13:50.460
already in love with someone?

13:53.180 --> 13:54.320
That's fine.

13:54.340 --> 13:56.360
Invite her to the banquet.

13:56.380 --> 13:57.700
On that occasion,

13:57.700 --> 14:00.220
noble girls will be there for selection.

14:00.460 --> 14:03.120
The late Empress and I

14:03.140 --> 14:04.760
were engaged like that

14:04.780 --> 14:06.080
years back.

14:06.100 --> 14:07.440
Yes.

14:07.460 --> 14:08.720
Thank you, Father.

14:08.740 --> 14:09.580
Besides,

14:09.580 --> 14:11.540
Prince Shu is older than you,

14:11.740 --> 14:13.220
yet he's also single.

14:13.380 --> 14:16.180
Consort Zhuang has urged me several times.

14:17.260 --> 14:18.840
Pass my order

14:18.860 --> 14:20.600
to her and Consort Xian

14:20.620 --> 14:22.600
to set up the banquet.

14:22.620 --> 14:23.980
Yes.

14:25.100 --> 14:26.360
Jin,

14:26.380 --> 14:28.140
what's that in your hand?

14:29.860 --> 14:31.300
Please, Eunuch Liu.

14:35.860 --> 14:38.900
It's Soothing Incense for you, Father.

14:39.500 --> 14:41.300
Good day, Father.

14:41.320 --> 14:47.200
(Fast and Persistent)

14:51.620 --> 14:52.960
A few days ago,

14:52.980 --> 14:54.600
I told Prince Yan

14:54.620 --> 14:56.280
your head hurt again.

14:56.300 --> 14:58.180
You couldn't sleep well.

15:01.620 --> 15:03.040
Big mouth.

15:03.060 --> 15:04.420
Sorry.

15:05.640 --> 15:08.120
(Fragrance Shop)

15:08.140 --> 15:10.440
Lately, I've been occupied, Yi,

15:10.460 --> 15:12.320
while our business has been booming.

15:12.340 --> 15:13.920
I have so much on my plate right now,

15:13.940 --> 15:15.640
so I could really

15:15.660 --> 15:16.760
use your help.

15:16.780 --> 15:18.380
You've already had Chuchu

15:18.380 --> 15:19.680
and Rou'er to help run the shop,

15:19.700 --> 15:21.120
and they've been doing so well.

15:21.140 --> 15:22.260
I can't do business.

15:22.260 --> 15:23.600
What if I ruin it?

15:23.620 --> 15:24.980
You won't.

15:25.100 --> 15:26.940
Ms. Yi, if you don't mind,

15:26.940 --> 15:28.460
feel free to ask me about management.

15:28.460 --> 15:30.220
I'll tell you everything I know.

15:30.340 --> 15:31.280
Yes, that's right.

15:31.300 --> 15:33.300
The more help, the better.

15:34.380 --> 15:36.260
I look forward to working with you.

15:38.700 --> 15:41.280
Thanks for the offer, Si.

15:41.300 --> 15:42.640
Once you have a career

15:42.660 --> 15:43.800
and feel fulfilled,

15:43.820 --> 15:45.780
you won't have time to get upset.

15:46.600 --> 15:48.480
(Prepare)

15:48.500 --> 15:50.180
It's late.

15:50.300 --> 15:52.380
(Spring Plowing)
Your head still hurts.

15:52.780 --> 15:54.580
You should rest, Your Majesty.

15:54.900 --> 15:57.300
Jin's incense is quite soothing.

15:57.620 --> 16:00.020
I'm feeling much better.

16:00.300 --> 16:02.840
Few can be as filial as Prince Yan.

16:02.860 --> 16:05.940
He's pure-hearted as well.

16:07.940 --> 16:09.520
He might be too pure,

16:09.540 --> 16:11.300
which worries me.

16:12.180 --> 16:13.660
He said he just wanted to

16:13.660 --> 16:15.820
marry a girl he loves.

16:16.700 --> 16:17.660
But a prince's marriage

16:17.660 --> 16:19.340
isn't that easy.

16:19.620 --> 16:20.740
Even I couldn't

16:20.740 --> 16:22.700
just be with someone I loved.

16:23.420 --> 16:24.780
Your Majesty,

16:24.820 --> 16:26.900
Physician Han's here with your medicine.

16:28.140 --> 16:29.500
Let him in.

16:31.500 --> 16:32.340
Your Majesty,

16:32.340 --> 16:34.620
your Soothing Soup for tonight.

16:36.300 --> 16:37.240
Take it away.

16:37.260 --> 16:38.560
It stinks.

16:38.580 --> 16:39.460
I finally

16:39.460 --> 16:41.760
found this prescription for you.

16:41.780 --> 16:43.440
Good medicine tastes bitter.

16:43.460 --> 16:45.920
Lately, your pulse has become stable,

16:45.940 --> 16:47.720
and your headache has been relieved

16:47.740 --> 16:50.220
- all because...
- Stop nagging.

16:50.380 --> 16:52.600
Baoping, pour it outside.

16:52.620 --> 16:53.520
Yes.

16:53.540 --> 16:54.520
Your Majesty,

16:54.540 --> 16:57.160
Princess Mingyue used her blood

16:57.180 --> 16:58.820
to decoct the herbs

16:58.820 --> 17:00.310
for you.

17:00.330 --> 17:01.180
Your Majesty,

17:01.180 --> 17:02.700
such love and devotion to you...

17:02.700 --> 17:04.220
What did you say?

17:09.220 --> 17:11.280
I'm going to the temple with Mother,

17:11.300 --> 17:12.700
so I can't come tomorrow.

17:12.720 --> 17:13.660
Decoct the herbs tonight

17:13.660 --> 17:15.440
for His Majesty to take tomorrow.

17:15.460 --> 17:17.560
But you've already lost so much blood.

17:17.580 --> 17:20.200
Any more and you'll collapse.

17:20.220 --> 17:21.580
It's fine.

17:21.980 --> 17:24.280
It's worth it for His Majesty's health.

17:24.300 --> 17:25.660
Mingyue.

17:27.740 --> 17:29.100
Uncle,

17:29.380 --> 17:31.260
what brings you here this late?

17:36.460 --> 17:38.820
Show me your arm.

17:41.460 --> 17:42.980
Physician Han,

17:43.260 --> 17:45.420
didn't I ask you not to tell my uncle?

17:46.020 --> 17:47.280
Your Grace,

17:47.300 --> 17:48.880
I didn't mean to.

17:48.900 --> 17:49.740
Your Majesty,

17:49.740 --> 17:51.800
Princess Mingyue comes every day,

17:51.820 --> 17:52.900
using her blood

17:52.900 --> 17:54.560
to make the decoction for you.

17:54.580 --> 17:56.420
The relief of your headache

17:56.420 --> 17:57.260
shows

17:57.260 --> 17:59.640
this prescription is working.

17:59.660 --> 18:00.740
Those medical books you read

18:00.740 --> 18:01.960
have made you a nerd.

18:01.980 --> 18:03.480
Do you believe such nonsense?

18:03.500 --> 18:05.740
Don't be mad, Uncle.

18:05.740 --> 18:06.820
I found that prescription

18:06.820 --> 18:08.460
and gave it to him.

18:09.140 --> 18:11.580
I was afraid you hadn't forgiven me,

18:11.620 --> 18:13.740
so I came by stealth...

18:14.220 --> 18:15.840
Mingyue! Mingyue!

18:15.860 --> 18:17.040
Can you hear me?

18:17.060 --> 18:19.180
- What's wrong?
- Excessive loss of blood

18:19.180 --> 18:20.540
can cause dizziness, Your Majesty.

18:20.540 --> 18:22.100
Hold her back to rest.

18:22.100 --> 18:23.460
Yes.

18:25.260 --> 18:26.620
Baoping,

18:26.700 --> 18:28.340
send a message to Rongyang.

18:28.460 --> 18:30.260
Yes, Your Majesty.

18:34.740 --> 18:36.420
Look at you

18:36.780 --> 18:39.040
always acting rashly.

18:39.060 --> 18:41.180
You're the apple of your mother's eye.

18:41.340 --> 18:42.720
If she sees you like this,

18:42.740 --> 18:44.560
she'll blame me for sure.

18:44.580 --> 18:46.660
I didn't tell her, of course.

18:47.180 --> 18:49.460
As long as you can be cured,

18:49.860 --> 18:51.180
I'll give up my life

18:51.180 --> 18:52.540
without hesitation.

18:52.780 --> 18:54.900
That's too sweet of you.

18:55.020 --> 18:57.400
I shall reward you. What do you want?

18:57.420 --> 18:59.940
May I marry

18:59.940 --> 19:01.820
Prince Yan?

19:02.340 --> 19:04.580
Knock it off, Mingyue.

19:06.500 --> 19:08.120
Good evening, Your Majesty.

19:08.140 --> 19:09.140
Don't take

19:09.140 --> 19:11.020
her words seriously.

19:11.380 --> 19:12.340
You simply helped

19:12.340 --> 19:13.680
treat your uncle for a few days.

19:13.700 --> 19:16.140
Are you taking his kindness for granted?

19:16.220 --> 19:17.640
No one in the Palace

19:17.660 --> 19:19.160
is as filial as her.

19:19.180 --> 19:20.440
From now on,

19:20.460 --> 19:22.900
she'll be reinstated as Commandery Princess.

19:23.140 --> 19:26.460
Thank your uncle, Mingyue!

19:31.180 --> 19:32.640
Thank you, Your Majesty.

19:34.400 --> 19:36.520
(Changle Palace)

19:36.540 --> 19:38.020
Back then,

19:38.380 --> 19:40.420
you stayed in this hall.

19:41.620 --> 19:42.720
The two of us

19:42.740 --> 19:45.100
always played games here.

19:45.820 --> 19:47.220
We did.

19:47.740 --> 19:49.100
Brother,

19:49.620 --> 19:51.260
remember

19:51.940 --> 19:53.860
I saw all the princesses

19:53.860 --> 19:56.340
had rare birds

19:56.380 --> 19:58.100
but me.

19:59.460 --> 20:01.220
To cheer me up,

20:01.620 --> 20:03.520
you went up this tree

20:03.540 --> 20:06.620
and gave me a nest of sparrows.

20:07.260 --> 20:08.820
You said

20:09.260 --> 20:12.420
no one in the Palace had sparrows but me,

20:12.740 --> 20:14.560
so my birds

20:14.580 --> 20:16.840
were even rarer.

20:16.860 --> 20:18.240
At that time,

20:18.260 --> 20:20.260
I was a neglected prince.

20:20.380 --> 20:21.740
That was the best

20:21.740 --> 20:23.600
I could do for you.

20:23.620 --> 20:25.420
You deserved better.

20:25.820 --> 20:27.380
Don't say that,

20:27.620 --> 20:29.620
or I'll be mad.

20:30.700 --> 20:33.080
Although we're only half-siblings,

20:33.100 --> 20:34.420
we lost our mothers

20:34.420 --> 20:35.980
in childhood

20:36.580 --> 20:38.500
and grew up

20:38.660 --> 20:40.340
with Grandmother.

20:41.020 --> 20:42.900
To me,

20:43.300 --> 20:46.740
such a bond means the world.

20:47.940 --> 20:49.300
I know.

20:49.460 --> 20:50.540
Time flies.

20:50.540 --> 20:51.620
We've been with each other

20:51.620 --> 20:53.100
for so long.

20:53.140 --> 20:55.540
Even Mingyue has grown up.

20:56.860 --> 20:58.220
Brother,

20:58.420 --> 21:00.020
she's spoiled

21:00.020 --> 21:01.380
and naive.

21:01.380 --> 21:02.580
She only said to marry Yu Jin

21:02.580 --> 21:04.480
on the spur of the moment.

21:04.500 --> 21:05.960
Don't worry.

21:05.980 --> 21:07.860
As much as I pamper her,

21:07.940 --> 21:10.500
I won't indulge her willfulness.

21:10.540 --> 21:12.040
She lost so much blood

21:12.060 --> 21:14.100
to help me recover.

21:14.220 --> 21:16.060
She's a wonderful girl.

21:16.540 --> 21:18.900
Although our family is different from others,

21:18.900 --> 21:20.640
we're concerned

21:20.660 --> 21:23.140
about our children's marriage

21:23.140 --> 21:25.300
the same as other parents.

21:26.780 --> 21:28.160
I've had Consort Xian hold

21:28.180 --> 21:30.420
a blossom-viewing banquet for Yu Jin.

21:30.580 --> 21:33.560
If Mingyue does have feelings for him,

21:33.580 --> 21:35.140
she may attend it as well

21:35.140 --> 21:36.620
and take the chance

21:36.780 --> 21:39.140
to see if they're meant to be together.

21:39.860 --> 21:41.900
Thanks for your kindness.

21:51.580 --> 21:53.300
You barged in so late.

21:53.900 --> 21:55.580
What if someone sees you?

21:56.700 --> 21:58.220
I don't care.

21:58.420 --> 21:59.780
I miss you.

22:00.180 --> 22:01.820
I wish they'd see me

22:02.300 --> 22:04.140
so that they'd know

22:04.540 --> 22:07.020
you're the only one I love.

22:08.460 --> 22:10.180
A banquet is going to be held

22:10.460 --> 22:12.450
to select wives for me and Prince Shu.

22:12.980 --> 22:13.860
I'll make sure

22:13.860 --> 22:16.340
you're invited to it.

22:16.740 --> 22:17.800
At that banquet,

22:17.820 --> 22:19.260
I'll tell everyone

22:19.260 --> 22:20.760
in public

22:20.780 --> 22:23.140
that I'll marry you.

22:34.420 --> 22:36.580
Do you expect me to be there

22:36.740 --> 22:38.880
to compete against those noble girls

22:38.900 --> 22:40.700
for you?

22:51.980 --> 22:54.060
I can't care less about them.

22:54.980 --> 22:56.740
Even if you do nothing,

22:57.100 --> 22:58.690
I'll choose no one but you.

22:58.860 --> 23:00.460
I don't deserve such honor.

23:00.580 --> 23:02.460
You're the noble Prince Yan

23:02.580 --> 23:04.740
while I'm merely a humble civilian.

23:04.980 --> 23:06.200
I don't belong

23:06.220 --> 23:07.620
to a prince's mansion.

23:08.220 --> 23:10.140
I'll leave someday

23:10.460 --> 23:12.580
to live my own life.

23:16.260 --> 23:18.580
Stop joking about that.

23:18.740 --> 23:20.340
Or I'll take it seriously.

23:24.660 --> 23:27.020
Serving the emperor is the riskiest.

23:27.780 --> 23:29.420
You have to ponder over

23:29.420 --> 23:31.080
everything he says and does

23:31.100 --> 23:33.820
to avoid even one misstep.

23:33.900 --> 23:35.420
It's fine

23:35.620 --> 23:36.860
to be a spoiled girl

23:36.860 --> 23:38.340
when he doesn't mind.

23:39.540 --> 23:42.020
But when he shows even the slightest sign

23:42.020 --> 23:43.480
of discontent,

23:43.500 --> 23:46.180
do not push your luck.

23:49.260 --> 23:50.580
His Majesty always seems

23:50.580 --> 23:52.580
good-tempered,

23:53.500 --> 23:55.560
misleading others into thinking

23:55.580 --> 23:58.580
he's a benevolent

23:58.580 --> 24:00.820
and guileless emperor.

24:00.860 --> 24:02.200
But the truth is

24:02.220 --> 24:04.020
he's most scheming.

24:04.860 --> 24:07.380
To be his favorite sister,

24:07.620 --> 24:10.280
I can't be like those fools

24:10.300 --> 24:13.360
asking him for more and more and more.

24:13.380 --> 24:15.700
If Uncle doesn't betroth me to Yu Jin,

24:17.660 --> 24:19.920
he won't marry me, will he?

24:19.940 --> 24:22.180
He only cares about Jiang Si.

24:24.060 --> 24:25.580
Why won't he?

24:26.460 --> 24:28.420
My daughter is

24:28.580 --> 24:31.640
an all-around talent.

24:31.660 --> 24:34.000
Also, in terms of looks,

24:34.020 --> 24:35.620
you're second to none.

24:36.580 --> 24:38.220
Now that His Majesty

24:38.500 --> 24:40.140
will hold a banquet for Yu Jin

24:40.140 --> 24:41.900
to select his wife,

24:42.060 --> 24:43.440
we'll

24:43.460 --> 24:45.980
make him choose you.

24:46.340 --> 24:47.980
You're so wise, Mother.

24:52.700 --> 24:54.060
It's late.

24:54.580 --> 24:56.220
You should leave, Prince Yan.

24:56.700 --> 24:58.380
I hope

24:59.420 --> 25:01.020
you'll enjoy the banquet

25:01.580 --> 25:02.940
and find your love.

25:05.100 --> 25:06.500
What?

25:07.420 --> 25:08.960
Are you asking me to leave?

25:08.980 --> 25:10.340
Yes.

25:10.540 --> 25:11.900
I need to rest.

25:31.260 --> 25:32.660
Didn't you just leave?

25:44.660 --> 25:46.980
I know as Prince Yan,

25:47.460 --> 25:50.060
the future will be even tougher.

25:50.220 --> 25:52.140
That's not your ideal life

25:52.420 --> 25:54.800
of having a small farm and a cottage.

25:54.820 --> 25:56.400
But you're the love of my life.

25:56.420 --> 25:57.660
You shall be with me forever.

25:57.660 --> 25:59.260
You're stuck with me

26:00.820 --> 26:02.620
unless you can't fulfill

26:02.820 --> 26:03.780
your long-cherished wish

26:03.780 --> 26:05.180
until we part.

26:05.940 --> 26:07.740
Then just tell me.

26:08.260 --> 26:09.620
I'll

26:10.060 --> 26:11.500
bid farewell to you.

26:13.900 --> 26:16.160
A small farm

26:16.180 --> 26:18.420
is way beneath a prince like you.

26:24.060 --> 26:25.700
But it seems fine

26:26.820 --> 26:28.420
for Yu Qi.

26:47.940 --> 26:49.300
Relax.

26:51.780 --> 26:53.660
I'll win at the banquet.

26:55.580 --> 26:57.260
Your love

26:57.940 --> 26:59.540
can only be me.

26:59.860 --> 27:01.940
You're right, my love.

27:05.700 --> 27:07.100
This jade pendant

27:07.900 --> 27:11.020
has been with me since childhood.

27:11.740 --> 27:13.400
When I'm away,

27:13.420 --> 27:14.880
it'll be with you as me.

27:45.880 --> 27:49.440
(Tiande Hall)

27:49.460 --> 27:52.640
(List of Noble Girls)
Invite kind

27:52.660 --> 27:54.300
and elegant girls from prominent clans

27:54.300 --> 27:55.900
to the banquet for Jin,

27:57.500 --> 28:00.420
as well as a few of noble birth.

28:01.420 --> 28:02.480
Yuhu.

28:02.500 --> 28:03.680
Yes.

28:03.700 --> 28:05.420
Send it to the Rites Office.

28:06.100 --> 28:07.460
Yes.

28:08.820 --> 28:09.980
I wonder who Consort Zhuang

28:09.980 --> 28:11.900
has invited.

28:13.540 --> 28:16.020
Your Highness, Prince Yan comes to greet you.

28:17.260 --> 28:18.560
All of a sudden?

28:18.580 --> 28:19.940
He's waiting outside.

28:19.940 --> 28:21.360
Will you let him in, Your Highness?

28:21.380 --> 28:22.860
Yes.

28:23.460 --> 28:24.420
I expect him

28:24.420 --> 28:26.140
to assist Zhang in the future.

28:26.420 --> 28:27.820
Send him in.

28:39.660 --> 28:42.180
Greetings, Mother.

28:42.420 --> 28:43.900
I'm glad to see you.

28:45.180 --> 28:46.740
Is everything alright?

28:46.980 --> 28:48.460
Has the date for the banquet

28:48.460 --> 28:49.440
been fixed?

28:49.460 --> 28:51.440
Yes, it's on the 18th.

28:51.460 --> 28:54.180
Are you concerned

28:54.180 --> 28:55.720
about my arrangement?

28:55.740 --> 28:57.100
Not at all.

28:57.540 --> 29:00.600
I guarded the South in the past years.

29:00.620 --> 29:03.280
I barely know any noble girl in town,

29:03.300 --> 29:04.420
but I long for

29:04.420 --> 29:06.320
a happy marriage.

29:06.340 --> 29:07.780
Whether or not

29:07.780 --> 29:09.880
I'll have a perfect wife

29:09.900 --> 29:12.020
depends on you, Mother.

29:14.380 --> 29:15.780
Trust me.

29:16.580 --> 29:18.140
I'll select just the one

29:18.140 --> 29:20.700
you want.

29:21.780 --> 29:24.300
I shall take my leave, Mother.

29:44.580 --> 29:47.700
When Jin and the Crown Prince fought,

29:47.900 --> 29:50.440
I thought he was wild and unruly.

29:50.460 --> 29:52.160
Turns out,

29:52.180 --> 29:53.720
he's simply childish.

29:53.740 --> 29:56.940
He's so looking forward to his marriage.

29:57.060 --> 29:58.420
Your Highness,

29:58.580 --> 30:00.980
with all due respect, Prince Yan

30:00.980 --> 30:01.980
seems...

30:01.980 --> 30:03.540
Too pure.

30:04.660 --> 30:06.440
That's actually a good thing.

30:06.460 --> 30:08.840
If he likes his wife,

30:08.860 --> 30:10.780
he'll listen to

30:10.900 --> 30:13.020
what she says.

30:13.500 --> 30:14.900
Then

30:15.140 --> 30:17.620
if I and his wife get along well,

30:17.980 --> 30:20.220
he'll help Zhang for sure.

30:20.500 --> 30:23.300
Jiang Si, the rest is up to you.

30:27.080 --> 30:31.440
(Lan Xingwen)

30:36.220 --> 30:37.440
Mr. Sun.

30:37.460 --> 30:38.780
Here's Consort Xian's guest list

30:38.780 --> 30:40.140
for the banquet.

30:41.640 --> 30:45.440
(Earl Dongping's Lineal Daughter, Jiang Si)

30:50.280 --> 30:56.360
(To Earl Dongping's Lineal Daughter,
Jiang Si)

30:56.380 --> 30:58.300
Si seems quiet,

30:58.300 --> 30:59.480
but look.

30:59.500 --> 31:01.340
She's invited to the Palace.

31:01.340 --> 31:02.680
This is great!

31:02.700 --> 31:04.500
What a big surprise!

31:07.580 --> 31:08.560
Grandmother.

31:08.580 --> 31:09.600
Si.

31:09.620 --> 31:10.560
Come here.

31:10.580 --> 31:11.900
Sit with me.

31:11.900 --> 31:13.260
Let's sit.

31:16.220 --> 31:19.260
Take a look, Si.

31:19.940 --> 31:20.820
An invitation

31:20.820 --> 31:23.380
from the Palace for you.

31:28.940 --> 31:30.320
A banquet is going to be held

31:30.340 --> 31:32.160
to select wives for me and Prince Shu.

31:32.180 --> 31:34.260
I'll make sure

31:34.260 --> 31:35.620
you're invited to it.

31:36.140 --> 31:37.980
Do you know

31:38.020 --> 31:39.060
why they

31:39.060 --> 31:41.380
sent you this invitation?

31:41.900 --> 31:43.460
No, Grandmother.

31:44.020 --> 31:45.720
I didn't know

31:45.740 --> 31:47.480
they had such a blossom-viewing banquet,

31:47.500 --> 31:48.980
let alone

31:49.220 --> 31:51.240
why I was invited to it.

31:51.260 --> 31:53.420
If so,

31:53.820 --> 31:56.700
why aren't you surprised?

31:57.460 --> 31:59.240
Don't you always tell us

31:59.260 --> 32:01.440
to remain calm no matter what?

32:01.460 --> 32:02.860
That's how a noble lady

32:02.860 --> 32:03.780
should behave.

32:03.780 --> 32:05.000
Mother!

32:05.020 --> 32:06.380
Mother!

32:06.500 --> 32:08.820
Did Si receive an invitation from the Palace?

32:09.380 --> 32:10.260
Did you also hear

32:10.260 --> 32:12.020
the great news?

32:13.900 --> 32:15.560
Blossom-viewing banquet?

32:15.580 --> 32:17.960
It's to select wives for princes.

32:17.980 --> 32:19.200
Si,

32:19.220 --> 32:20.060
you can't go.

32:20.060 --> 32:22.040
Are you insane?

32:22.060 --> 32:24.200
It came directly from the Palace.

32:24.220 --> 32:25.860
Was it Yu Qi's doing?

32:26.740 --> 32:29.280
What was it to do with him?

32:29.300 --> 32:30.140
Mother,

32:30.140 --> 32:33.220
Yu Qi is the 7th Prince, Yu Jin!

32:34.180 --> 32:37.160
Him? The 7th Prince?

32:37.180 --> 32:40.260
That's why Si cannot go!

32:42.060 --> 32:43.820
I... I always think

32:43.820 --> 32:45.520
he's a wonderful young man.

32:45.540 --> 32:48.140
If he and Si tie the knot,

32:48.140 --> 32:50.540
that'll be a beautiful story.

32:50.900 --> 32:51.900
Besides,

32:51.900 --> 32:52.980
for all we know,

32:52.980 --> 32:54.820
she might not be selected.

32:54.820 --> 32:57.600
But with this invitation,

32:57.620 --> 32:59.220
everyone in our clan can finally

32:59.220 --> 33:01.020
hold our heads high.

33:01.020 --> 33:03.100
And it'll be much easier

33:03.100 --> 33:04.980
for you to marry.

33:06.260 --> 33:07.320
Father,

33:07.340 --> 33:09.960
it's not easy to be selected.

33:09.980 --> 33:11.080
Besides,

33:11.100 --> 33:12.960
this invitation came from the Palace.

33:12.980 --> 33:14.260
It's not like

33:14.260 --> 33:15.820
we can turn it down.

33:16.100 --> 33:17.880
Exactly.

33:17.900 --> 33:19.420
Si,

33:19.900 --> 33:21.940
go back and prepare yourself for the banquet.

33:21.940 --> 33:22.840
Tell the butler

33:22.860 --> 33:24.460
if you need anything.

33:25.140 --> 33:26.860
I have two sets

33:26.860 --> 33:28.260
of fine jewelry.

33:28.260 --> 33:31.020
I'll have Fu bring them to you.

33:31.180 --> 33:32.160
Thanks, Grandmother.

33:32.180 --> 33:33.440
By the way,

33:33.460 --> 33:35.740
keep in mind what I'm about to say.

33:36.020 --> 33:38.240
Follow the rules in the Palace.

33:38.260 --> 33:40.040
Watch your ears.

33:40.060 --> 33:42.160
Watch your eyes.

33:42.180 --> 33:43.660
Watch your mouth.

33:43.660 --> 33:46.260
Do what others do.

33:46.740 --> 33:48.300
Remember,

33:48.620 --> 33:51.920
do not stir up trouble.

33:51.940 --> 33:53.480
Prince Yan,

33:53.500 --> 33:55.620
these are made

33:55.620 --> 33:57.440
of the finest Hetian Jade:

33:57.460 --> 33:59.240
jade plates, jade bowls,

33:59.260 --> 34:01.200
jade pots, and jade pillows.

34:01.220 --> 34:03.560
Here's stationery

34:03.580 --> 34:04.860
from the Longyan Shop.

34:04.860 --> 34:05.820
(Peaceful and Carefree)

34:05.820 --> 34:08.100
These are landscape scrolls

34:08.100 --> 34:10.060
by the Great Four of Dazhou.

34:12.780 --> 34:14.320
What are these for, Aunt?

34:14.340 --> 34:16.000
My daughter, Mingyue,

34:16.020 --> 34:17.980
admires you.

34:18.380 --> 34:19.920
If you choose to

34:19.940 --> 34:21.480
marry her at the banquet,

34:21.500 --> 34:24.240
I'll let go of the past

34:24.260 --> 34:26.980
and guarantee you a bright future.

34:27.260 --> 34:28.860
Tell me, Aunt.

34:28.940 --> 34:30.480
How will you guarantee that?

34:30.500 --> 34:31.700
What if

34:31.700 --> 34:34.340
I can make you the Crown Prince?

34:36.420 --> 34:37.560
Really?

34:37.580 --> 34:38.860
Yu Lang has no talent or virtue

34:38.860 --> 34:40.200
but he hasn't been deposed.

34:40.220 --> 34:42.480
Do you know why?

34:42.500 --> 34:44.380
That's because of you, of course.

34:45.660 --> 34:47.060
Too bad,

34:47.780 --> 34:49.280
I have zero interest

34:49.300 --> 34:50.800
in that position.

34:50.820 --> 34:52.160
I'm unambitious.

34:52.180 --> 34:55.780
I just want to be a carefree prince.

34:56.380 --> 34:58.000
You were born cursed.

34:58.020 --> 34:59.600
His Majesty might've forgotten,

34:59.620 --> 35:01.940
but I haven't.

35:02.420 --> 35:04.800
Neither have those court officials.

35:04.820 --> 35:06.540
His Majesty yielded

35:07.060 --> 35:08.460
to their demand when they kneeled

35:08.460 --> 35:10.400
and sent you to the South.

35:10.420 --> 35:12.900
That can happen again.

35:14.100 --> 35:18.300
But I can also make them forget everything.

35:20.420 --> 35:22.300
Your Highness,

35:22.420 --> 35:24.020
do you really think

35:24.020 --> 35:25.720
you can always get your way,

35:25.740 --> 35:27.640
and a few words you say

35:27.660 --> 35:28.780
can change

35:28.780 --> 35:30.260
my life?

35:38.060 --> 35:39.400
Absolutely.

35:39.420 --> 35:41.820
I'm running out of patience.

35:42.660 --> 35:45.280
Don't try to do anything stupid.

35:45.300 --> 35:47.540
Goodbye, Your Highness.

36:00.660 --> 36:01.680
Chief,

36:01.700 --> 36:02.570
shall I take them away

36:02.570 --> 36:03.420
and throw them out?

36:03.420 --> 36:06.140
Keep them. They're quite valuable.

36:09.140 --> 36:10.500
What?

36:10.580 --> 36:12.480
A banquet in the Palace?

36:12.500 --> 36:13.720
Yes.

36:13.740 --> 36:16.300
They say it's to select princes' wives.

36:19.380 --> 36:22.060
Select princes' wives?

36:24.260 --> 36:25.280
Other than Si,

36:25.300 --> 36:26.520
who else was invited?

36:26.540 --> 36:28.540
Only she received the invitation.

36:28.580 --> 36:30.280
Everyone in our house says

36:30.300 --> 36:31.300
perhaps Miss Si

36:31.300 --> 36:33.180
will become a princess.

36:36.340 --> 36:37.620
If she

36:37.620 --> 36:39.200
marries a prince,

36:39.220 --> 36:40.480
the First Branch

36:40.500 --> 36:43.020
will walk on air,

36:44.660 --> 36:47.180
leaving even less room for us to survive.

36:47.740 --> 36:49.180
Don't worry too much.

36:49.220 --> 36:50.940
Miss Si was born a jinx.

36:50.940 --> 36:52.040
She's not blessed.

36:52.060 --> 36:53.940
She can't be a princess.

36:55.900 --> 36:57.820
She wants to

36:57.900 --> 36:59.900
be a princess?

37:03.140 --> 37:04.780
In her dreams!

37:09.040 --> 37:11.560
(Tiande Hall)

37:11.580 --> 37:13.340
The Palace is huge!

37:14.860 --> 37:16.200
Young Master Zhan!

37:16.220 --> 37:17.320
Si!

37:17.340 --> 37:18.700
Zhan.

37:19.020 --> 37:20.380
Are you nervous?

37:20.700 --> 37:22.060
I'm fine.

37:22.100 --> 37:23.060
Go back to work

37:23.060 --> 37:25.100
in case others see you leave.

37:25.700 --> 37:27.060
It's fine.

37:29.380 --> 37:30.740
What's that?

37:30.940 --> 37:32.500
Rose Fudge.

37:33.100 --> 37:35.660
Eat sweets for good luck.

37:36.180 --> 37:37.540
Sure.

37:39.380 --> 37:40.680
Is it sweet?

37:40.700 --> 37:41.760
Yes.

37:41.780 --> 37:42.800
Trust me.

37:42.820 --> 37:44.380
Luck will be on my side.

37:46.620 --> 37:47.650
Your Grace, your new dress

37:47.660 --> 37:48.560
looks stunning.

37:48.580 --> 37:50.490
Where did you have it made?

37:50.510 --> 37:52.480
I wish I could
go to the Imperial Garden with you.

37:52.500 --> 37:54.520
Do tell me everything when you get back.

37:54.540 --> 37:56.420
Sure. I'll leave out no details

37:56.420 --> 37:58.220
of what I saw.

38:02.900 --> 38:04.460
How come Miss Si's dress

38:04.460 --> 38:07.620
looks identical to Princess Mingyue's?

38:08.420 --> 38:09.820
Greetings, Your Grace.

38:10.060 --> 38:11.580
How shameless!

38:13.180 --> 38:15.540
How dare you dress like me!

38:16.340 --> 38:17.560
Take that off.

38:17.580 --> 38:18.920
Your Grace,

38:18.940 --> 38:20.320
my dress was tailor-made

38:20.340 --> 38:21.300
by the Tianxiu Shop

38:21.300 --> 38:23.140
on Zhuque Street.

38:23.500 --> 38:25.240
I drew the design

38:25.260 --> 38:27.020
and picked the fabric.

38:27.140 --> 38:29.400
Did the Grand Princess's tailor

38:29.420 --> 38:31.500
copy it from that shop,

38:31.540 --> 38:33.340
or did you

38:33.700 --> 38:35.860
copy my dress on purpose?

38:43.060 --> 38:44.420
Hong,

38:44.900 --> 38:47.180
tear up her dress.

38:48.620 --> 38:49.960
What are you doing?

38:49.980 --> 38:51.260
- Stop!
- Aman...

38:51.260 --> 38:52.620
Stop it!

38:56.500 --> 38:58.740
- Mother.
- Grand Princess.

39:00.860 --> 39:02.660
That was rude of Mingyue.

39:02.660 --> 39:04.180
She offended you.

39:04.500 --> 39:06.900
Please forgive her, Miss Si.

39:07.020 --> 39:08.600
Of course, Your Highness.

39:08.620 --> 39:09.980
I won't

39:10.100 --> 39:12.100
hold it against her.

39:20.540 --> 39:21.900
Mother,

39:22.020 --> 39:22.940
I simply meant to

39:22.940 --> 39:24.240
teach that vixen a lesson.

39:24.260 --> 39:25.980
Why did you stop me?

39:27.060 --> 39:28.400
Mingyue,

39:28.420 --> 39:30.780
if you want someone dead,

39:31.780 --> 39:34.520
be the nicest aboveboard

39:34.540 --> 39:37.860
while doing the worst under the table.

39:38.380 --> 39:40.520
If you make too big a fuss,

39:40.540 --> 39:41.720
once she dies,

39:41.740 --> 39:44.620
you'll be to blame.

39:45.540 --> 39:46.960
Lesson learned, Mother.

39:48.340 --> 39:51.180
You still have a lot more to learn.

40:05.600 --> 40:07.520
(Palace, Imperial Garden)

40:07.540 --> 40:10.180
The consorts have arrived!

40:14.240 --> 40:17.280
(Fragrant and Sparse)

40:17.400 --> 40:20.200
(Consort Zhuang)

40:23.180 --> 40:25.540
Greetings, Your Highness.

40:25.740 --> 40:27.140
Rise.

40:28.860 --> 40:31.280
Please be seated, Consort Zhuang.

40:31.300 --> 40:32.780
After you, Consort Xian.

40:35.900 --> 40:38.340
The princes have arrived!

40:46.940 --> 40:48.100
- Brother.
- Jin.

40:48.100 --> 40:50.760
(Prince Shu)

40:51.700 --> 40:54.140
Greetings, Your Highness.

41:15.310 --> 41:16.170
After you, Brother.

41:16.180 --> 41:17.540
Please.

41:19.500 --> 41:21.620
Please, Consort Zhuang.

41:23.220 --> 41:24.120
Begin.

41:24.140 --> 41:25.000
Yes.

41:25.020 --> 41:28.940
I'm Censor Sun Congxin of Rites.

41:29.660 --> 41:31.660
I'll be the question master

41:31.660 --> 41:32.940
for your competition

41:32.940 --> 41:34.940
at today's banquet.

41:35.100 --> 41:37.140
Now, peonies are in full bloom,

41:37.140 --> 41:38.480
outshining each other,

41:38.500 --> 41:40.080
so flowers will be the questions.

41:40.100 --> 41:42.040
There will be three rounds.

41:42.060 --> 41:44.280
Round one, draw them.

41:44.300 --> 41:46.240
Round two, arrange them.

41:46.260 --> 41:48.600
Round three, appreciate them.

41:48.620 --> 41:50.240
Ladies, I hope you'll

41:50.260 --> 41:51.780
impress everyone

41:51.780 --> 41:53.680
and show all your talent.

41:53.700 --> 41:56.480
Round one, peonies.

41:56.500 --> 41:59.240
You'll have two hours to draw.

41:59.260 --> 42:00.980
You may begin.

42:27.400 --> 42:30.240
(Jiang Si)

42:32.540 --> 42:35.700
Is that Earl Dongping's daughter?

42:35.820 --> 42:37.500
I thought

42:37.700 --> 42:40.060
Consort Zhuang could've done better,

42:40.540 --> 42:42.870
but I overestimated her.

42:42.890 --> 42:45.940
I can't believe she invited such a girl.

42:46.380 --> 42:47.480
What's wrong with her?

42:47.500 --> 42:48.620
Jiang Si

42:48.620 --> 42:51.020
might own unmatched beauty,

42:51.100 --> 42:52.360
but

42:52.380 --> 42:55.700
her family and personality are...

43:10.320 --> 43:14.680
(The End of Episode 26)

43:15.130 --> 43:16.860
♪ From place to place ♪

43:16.860 --> 43:21.800
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:22.170 --> 43:24.550
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:24.550 --> 43:28.780
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:29.490 --> 43:31.890
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:31.910 --> 43:35.570
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:35.590 --> 43:39.010
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:39.160 --> 43:44.680
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:49.180
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:49.180 --> 43:53.260
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.240
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:55.260 --> 43:59.960
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:59.960 --> 44:03.530
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:03.550 --> 44:07.780
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:07.800 --> 44:09.580
♪ Time glows ♪

44:09.580 --> 44:14.120
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:14.140 --> 44:18.940
♪ And stars ♪

44:23.170 --> 44:25.700
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:25.720 --> 44:29.340
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:29.360 --> 44:32.790
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:32.810 --> 44:37.430
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:37.430 --> 44:41.120
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:41.140 --> 44:45.230
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:45.340 --> 44:47.160
♪ Time glows ♪

44:47.160 --> 44:51.710
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:51.730 --> 44:55.430
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:55.450 --> 44:59.610
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:59.790 --> 45:01.550
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

45:01.550 --> 45:06.070
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

45:06.070 --> 45:09.710
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

45:09.730 --> 45:15.400
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

45:17.090 --> 45:19.020
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

45:19.020 --> 45:26.520
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
